SUMMARY:Topsy-Turvy\, a night of magicians and character comedy
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Topsy Turvy\, a night of magicians and character comedy! This performance is a chance for magicians to try out new tricks and for comedians to test out kooky characters. \nThis show is presented at a pop-up venue at Brightleaf Square\, right next to Emmy Squared Pizza! Thanks to Durham Arts Guild for their partnership and welcoming us into this space. \nLineup:\nKevin Burke – Magician\, Las Vegas Performer of the Year\, 2006\nDan Harlan – Magician\, “The Most Versatile Magician in the World”\nSean MacBain – Magician\, “A Master of Closeup Miracles”\nMikki Marvel – Character Comic\, “An astonishing variety of wigs\, costumes\, and voices”\nNik Narain – Character Comic\, Edinburgh Fringe 2025\, New York Fringe 2025 \n**More performers to be announced \nThis show is for adults 18+
URL:https://unitedarts.org/calendar/topsy-turvy-a-night-of-magicians-and-character-comedy/
LOCATION:Brightleaf Square\, 905 West Main Street\, Durham\, 27701
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://unitedarts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Topsy-Turvy-Graphic.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Triangle Sketch Comedy":MAILTO:trianglesketch@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
