SUMMARY:Summerfest: Epic Film Scores with the North Carolina Symphony
DESCRIPTION:Pack your picnic and enjoy iconic film music—from the triumphant Chariots of Fire to the epic journey of The Lord of the Rings and the sweeping romance of Titanic—performed live in symphonic splendor. An unforgettable summer night of music\, movies\, and memories.  \nNorth Carolina Symphony\nLawrence Loh\, conductor \nUNC Health Summerfest offers great music under the stars at Koka Booth Amphitheatre in Cary—and remember\, kids 12 & under are always admitted free on the lawn!
URL:https://unitedarts.org/calendar/summerfest-epic-film-scores-with-the-north-carolina-symphony/
LOCATION:Koka Booth Amphitheatre\, 8003 Regency Pkwy\, Cary\, 27518
CATEGORIES:Concert
ORGANIZER;CN="North Carolina Symphony":MAILTO:tickets@ncsymphony.org
END:VEVENT
